      <title>From: Coston Climmons, To: Ruby Chandler</title>
      <link>//localhost:1313/1900/01/01/43/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 1900 23:30:04 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/1900/01/01/43/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/1900/01/postcard-2014-20140407_17330471_0001.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140407_17330471_0001&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/1900/01/postcard-2014-20140407_17330471_0001.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/1900/01/postcard-2014-20140407_17302431_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140407_17302431_0002&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/1900/01/postcard-2014-20140407_17302431_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17302431_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: Coston Climmons, To: Ruby Chandler &lt;a href=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17302431_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Milton, Jime, and Ruby,&lt;br&gt;
Please accept congratulations. We will be glad to have you with us this winter.&lt;br&gt;
Sincerely,&lt;br&gt;
Caston Climmons&lt;/p&gt;</description>
